          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERI-NPC12_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Can I help you? Advice on attracting a Sky Squid? Sure: Don't. But for argument's sake, I'd probably use a Flying Glowfish as bait.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kalamar_CitizenF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Valantis_EMP_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1397633,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERI-NPC12_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Flying Glowfish's bioluminescence makes them stand out in the murky Aethyr, but it's their pungent odor - *oof* -  that Sky Squids can't resist.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kalamar_CitizenF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Valantis_EMP_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1397633,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERI-NPC12_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Of course, catching a Flying Glowfish is even harder than catching a Sky Squid, so you'd want to create a massive Flying Glowfish lure.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kalamar_CitizenF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Valantis_EMP_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1397633,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERI-NPC12_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But even if you could create a lure that big, that shiny, that stinky, you'd still never reel in a Sky Squid. They swallow everything whole!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kalamar_CitizenF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Valantis_EMP_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1397633,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
